{"schemaVersion":1,"generatedAt":"2026-08-16T16:20:46.501Z","id":"020ac7a9aacbb62b3be78dd2","canonicalUrl":"https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260814133925.1385687-1-ruoyuw560%40gmail.com/","channels":["linux-arm-kernel"],"thread":{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"thread:lore-git:20260814133925.1385687-1-ruoyuw560@gmail.com","source":{"kind":"static-generated","canonicalThreadUrl":"https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260814133925.1385687-1-ruoyuw560%40gmail.com/","fetchedAt":"2026-08-16T16:20:46.501Z","contentDigest":"lore-git:20260814133925.1385687-1-ruoyuw560@gmail.com"},"subject":"Re: [PATCH] perf/dwc_pcie: Fix PCI device reference leak in probe","messages":{"7321c855-08b7-4270-9d98-297a872ad47d@linux.alibaba.com":{"id":"7321c855-08b7-4270-9d98-297a872ad47d@linux.alibaba.com","messageId":"7321c855-08b7-4270-9d98-297a872ad47d@linux.alibaba.com","references":["20260814133925.1385687-1-ruoyuw560@gmail.com"],"missingAncestorIds":["20260814133925.1385687-1-ruoyuw560@gmail.com"],"author":{"name":"Shuai Xue","address":"xueshuai@linux.alibaba.com"},"sender":{"name":"linux-arm-kernel","address":"linux-arm-kernel-bounces@lists.infradead.org"},"replyTo":[],"to":[{"name":"Ruoyu Wang","address":"ruoyuw560@gmail.com"},{"name":"Jing Zhang","address":"renyu.zj@linux.alibaba.com"},{"name":"Will Deacon","address":"will@kernel.org"},{"name":"Mark Rutland","address":"mark.rutland@arm.com"},{"name":"Yunhui Cui","address":"cuiyunhui@bytedance.com"}],"cc":[{"name":"","address":"linux-arm-kernel@lists.infradead.org"},{"name":"","address":"linux-perf-users@vger.kernel.org"},{"name":"","address":"linux-kernel@vger.kernel.org"}],"timestamp":{"raw":"2026-08-16T01:42:36.000Z","iso":"2026-08-16T01:42:36.000Z","valid":true},"subject":"Re: [PATCH] perf/dwc_pcie: Fix PCI device reference leak in probe","mailingLists":[{"id":"linux-arm-kernel.lists.infradead.org","displayName":"linux-arm-kernel.lists.infradead.org","address":"linux-arm-kernel@lists.infradead.org"}],"blocks":[{"kind":"quote","attribution":"On 8/14/26 9:39 PM, Ruoyu Wang wrote:","lines":[{"depth":1,"text":"pci_get_domain_bus_and_slot() returns a referenced PCI device. When the"},{"depth":1,"text":"subsequent RAS DES capability lookup fails, dwc_pcie_pmu_probe() returns"},{"depth":1,"text":"-ENODEV without releasing that reference. Repeated failed probes can"},{"depth":1,"text":"therefore keep the PCI device allocated after removal."},{"depth":1,"text":"> Move the existing pci_dev_put() immediately after capability discovery"},{"depth":1,"text":"so the temporary lookup reference is released on both success and"},{"depth":1,"text":"failure paths."},{"depth":1,"text":"> This issue was found by a static analysis checker and confirmed by"},{"depth":1,"text":"manual source review."},{"depth":1,"text":"> Fixes: 7f35b429802a (\"perf/dwc_pcie: fix duplicate pci_dev devices\")"},{"depth":1,"text":"Signed-off-by: Ruoyu Wang <ruoyuw560@gmail.com>"},{"depth":1,"text":"---"},{"depth":1,"text":"  drivers/perf/dwc_pcie_pmu.c | 2 +-"},{"depth":1,"text":"  1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)"},{"depth":1,"text":"> diff --git a/drivers/perf/dwc_pcie_pmu.c b/drivers/perf/dwc_pcie_pmu.c"},{"depth":1,"text":"index 5385401fa9cf6..baa736fd9a6ef 100644"},{"depth":1,"text":"--- a/drivers/perf/dwc_pcie_pmu.c"},{"depth":1,"text":"+++ b/drivers/perf/dwc_pcie_pmu.c"},{"depth":1,"text":"@@ -710,10 +710,10 @@ static int dwc_pcie_pmu_probe(struct platform_device *plat_dev)"},{"depth":1,"text":"  \t}"},{"depth":1,"text":"  >   \tvsec = dwc_pcie_des_cap(pdev);"},{"depth":1,"text":"+\tpci_dev_put(pdev);"},{"depth":1,"text":"  \tif (!vsec)"},{"depth":1,"text":"  \t\treturn -ENODEV;"},{"depth":1,"text":"  > -\tpci_dev_put(pdev);"},{"depth":1,"text":"  \tname = devm_kasprintf(&plat_dev->dev, GFP_KERNEL, \"dwc_rootport_%x\", sbdf);"},{"depth":1,"text":"  \tif (!name)"},{"depth":1,"text":"  \t\treturn -ENOMEM;"}],"lineCount":28,"maximumDepth":1},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Good catch."},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Reviewed-by: Shuai Xue <xueshuai@linux.alibaba.com>"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Thanks.\nShuai"}],"patchIds":[],"attachmentMetadata":[],"sourceOrdinal":0,"diagnostics":[],"declaredParentMessageId":"20260814133925.1385687-1-ruoyuw560@gmail.com"},"0abb2aab-4752-478d-bb53-c5a84fd6ba2d@web.de":{"id":"0abb2aab-4752-478d-bb53-c5a84fd6ba2d@web.de","messageId":"0abb2aab-4752-478d-bb53-c5a84fd6ba2d@web.de","references":["20260814133925.1385687-1-ruoyuw560@gmail.com"],"missingAncestorIds":["20260814133925.1385687-1-ruoyuw560@gmail.com"],"author":{"name":"Markus Elfring","address":"Markus.Elfring@web.de"},"sender":{"name":"linux-arm-kernel","address":"linux-arm-kernel-bounces@lists.infradead.org"},"replyTo":[],"to":[{"name":"Ruoyu Wang","address":"ruoyuw560@gmail.com"},{"name":"","address":"linux-perf-users@vger.kernel.org"},{"name":"","address":"linux-arm-kernel@lists.infradead.org"},{"name":"Jing Zhang","address":"renyu.zj@linux.alibaba.com"},{"name":"Mark Rutland","address":"mark.rutland@arm.com"},{"name":"Shuai Xue","address":"xueshuai@linux.alibaba.com"},{"name":"Will Deacon","address":"will@kernel.org"},{"name":"Yunhui Cui","address":"cuiyunhui@bytedance.com"}],"cc":[{"name":"LKML","address":"linux-kernel@vger.kernel.org"},{"name":"","address":"kernel-janitors@vger.kernel.org"}],"timestamp":{"raw":"2026-08-16T08:26:39.000Z","iso":"2026-08-16T08:26:39.000Z","valid":true},"subject":"Re: [PATCH] perf/dwc_pcie: Fix PCI device reference leak in probe","mailingLists":[{"id":"linux-arm-kernel.lists.infradead.org","displayName":"linux-arm-kernel.lists.infradead.org","address":"linux-arm-kernel@lists.infradead.org"}],"blocks":[{"kind":"paragraph","text":"…"},{"kind":"quote","lines":[{"depth":1,"text":"Move the existing pci_dev_put() immediately after capability discovery"},{"depth":1,"text":"so the temporary lookup reference is released on both success and"},{"depth":1,"text":"failure paths."}],"lineCount":3,"maximumDepth":1},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"…"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"How do you think about to apply the attribute “__free(pci_dev_put)”?\nhttps://elixir.bootlin.com/linux/v7.2-rc7/source/include/linux/pci.h#L1269"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Regards,\nMarkus"}],"patchIds":[],"attachmentMetadata":[],"sourceOrdinal":1,"diagnostics":[],"declaredParentMessageId":"20260814133925.1385687-1-ruoyuw560@gmail.com"}},"rootIds":["7321c855-08b7-4270-9d98-297a872ad47d@linux.alibaba.com","0abb2aab-4752-478d-bb53-c5a84fd6ba2d@web.de"],"childrenByParent":{},"chronologicalIds":["7321c855-08b7-4270-9d98-297a872ad47d@linux.alibaba.com","0abb2aab-4752-478d-bb53-c5a84fd6ba2d@web.de"],"patchSeries":[],"diagnostics":[],"patches":{}}}